Thanks for confirming. What _specific_ data is RCR sharing with Bolt here? For example, is RCR sharing: (a) the name / contact info / VIN of the specific drivers that acquired vehicles; or (b) merely aggregated information(e.g., “_25 drivers acquired the vehicles this week_”)?

