{quote}_We also plan to incentivize this vehicles with branding bonuses, so we also need to identify they ones that take the offer in order to brand them._{quote}

So just to be clear on this, RCR will be providing us with relevant driver data so that we can: (1) measure the success of the partnership; and (2) identify which vehicles will be subject to branding, and reach out to those drivers? If so then this does not change any of my suggested edits - it is more for my understanding. 

