Nevertheless, I appreciate that you are working to tight timelines, and so I can offer the following from my side - would this be enough? If not, then I would recommend looping in Ops for further information.

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
* Bolt uses cloud solutions providers for certain BAU activities, including Amazon Web Services (for data storage), Google Drive and Box (for file-sharing / management).
* Where such third-party cloud storage providers are used, our preference is always to either: (a) ensure that the data is stored in the European Union; or (b) ensure that the data is stored in a country that has received an adequacy decision from the EU Commission _(_*_INTERNAL NOTE:_* _This is not always achieved, but it is what we push for and applies in most cases)_.
{panel}

